## Playable arcade games
Games is the first tab after sign-in. Learners start at Level 1 with 0 XP. Pop Goes the Word has five rounds and three hearts per run. The first run starts with SUMAKAY. A wrong check costs one heart. Each solved round earns 20 XP. Running out of hearts ends the run and saves the points and XP already earned. Every 100 XP adds one level. Preview stores XP and personal bests in the browser. Configured account play uses server-validated runs, shared rankings, and per-skill attempt logging for all seven games. Whack-a-Word unlocks at Level 3. Each correct answer earns 100 points and 10 XP. The word window starts at 10 seconds and drops by 1 second every five correct answers to a minimum of 5 seconds. An incorrect answer or timeout costs one of three lives. Untimed practice earns XP and is excluded from timed best scores. Toss-a-Lapi unlocks at Level 5. A five-round run covers Unlapi, Gitlapi, Hulapi, and Kabilaan using sentence prompts and movable tiles. Completing the run earns 100 XP, and the browser saves the best score. Memory Match unlocks at Level 7. Players flip pairs of root-word cards across three boards of 6, 8, and 10 cards. After each board they review the compound words and their meanings. Completing all three boards earns 100 XP, and the browser saves the best score. Ticket Stub Dispenser unlocks at Level 9. A five-round run uses sentence prompts and two print levers to practice Ganap and Parsiyal. Each correct pull prints the repeated portion and the root word. Completing a run earns 100 XP, and the browser saves the best score. Claw Machine unlocks at Level 11. In five rounds, learners grab the doll that matches the verb focus in each sentence. A run covers Tagaganap, Layon, Ganapan, and Tagatanggap. Completing a run earns 100 XP, and the browser saves the best score. Fortune Predict unlocks at Level 13. In five rounds, the player predicts whether pang- changes to pam- or pan- or remains pang-, then prints the resulting word. Completing a run earns 100 XP and saves the best score in the browser. All seven games are playable.

